1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:05,340
For most of this semester,I've said absolutely nothing in tutorials.
在这个学期的多数时间里，我在课上都没有说过话。

2
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:13,400
But recently,I've been trying to speak up more and I just jump in, and I've noticed an interesting thing.
但是最近我试着多发表意见，我投入到讨论中并发现了一件有趣的事情。

3
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:21,210
I've noticed that if they thought my point was interesting or new, then the next time they actually asked for my opinion,
我发现如果他们认为我的观点很有趣或新颖，下一次他们就会询问我的意见，

4
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:25,010
and then it was much easier for me to be part of the discussion.
这就使我顺利的加入到讨论中去。

5
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:31,990
That's great,Hiroko! I hope that happens for me next semester - I'll have to work hard to find some interesting points.
太好了，Hiroko！希望下学期我也能这样。我得努力学习找出一些有趣的观点。

6
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,410
What helped you to find these ideas?
我得努力学习找出一些有趣的观点。

7
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:38,440
I think that one thing that helped me with this was the reading.
我认为是读书帮了我。

8
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:44,330
I've had to do so much reading this semester just to help me make sense of the lectures.
这学期我不得不读很多的书，以帮我理解讲课的内容。

9
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:52,220
At first I couldn't understand what the lecturers were talking about, so I had to turn to the books and journals.
起初，我不明白老师在讲什么，所以我不得不看书和期刊。

10
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:59,940
Every night I read for hours,using the lists of references that were given, and I made pages of notes.
每晚我都照着参考书单读几个小时的书，我还做了很多页的笔记。

11
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:03,320
At breakfast,I read and read my notes again.
早餐时，我一遍遍地读我的笔记。

12
00:01:03,330 --> 00:01:12,250
This habit has helped me to follow the ideas in the lectures, and it's also given me some ideas to use in the tutorials.
这个习惯帮我跟上了讲课的思路，并且在讨论课上带给我许多启发。

13
00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:18,040
But i did so much reading anyway - I don't think there's any time left over for anything extra.
但是我也做了许多阅读，我认为没有什么时间做这些额外的事情。

14
00:01:18,050 --> 00:01:24,330
My reading speed is still quite slow, though I'm much better at dealing with vocabulary than I used to be.
我的读书速度还是很慢，尽管我现在比过去在处理词汇上要好很多。
